Z||000001||FieroMaster88||05-13-2001||09:52 PM||||The group I am goin with and myself are staying in harrasburg.  It was $69 a night or something like that and harrasburg is only a little ways away from carlisle.  All the rooms were taken in carlisle..<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">        <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe 30,000 miles  <IMG SRC="http://cwm.ragesofsanity.com/s/net4/smiling2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Taijiguy||05-13-2001||11:19 PM||||Carlisle. Geeze. I remember being there in 81 or 82. My dad bought a perfect '69 442 convertible from some guy there for $3,000. He said he couldn't get it to run. We pushed it over to the lot, pulled the distributor, turned it 180 deg. and drove it home. Six years later we sold it for $15,000. I also remember the traffic at the end of the last day. A line of cars that went on for miles. I peed on the side of a church I had to go so bad. <BR>Alot of funny stories from there. Maybe I should start a thread for stories about Carlisle...||||reg||1
Z||000003||kslish||05-14-2001||01:29 AM||||I was quoted a price of $64 when I reserved my room at the Carlisle Motel 6.  I'm hoping they will knock a couple of bucks off with my AAA membership. <P>I think that the individual that I was going to share my room with may cancel on me, so I may be looking for a roommate to offset some of the cost.  I'm going to check with my local club members first and if no one bites I'll post it here on the list.  I can't see spending that kind of money on a room that I'm only going to sleep in anyways.<P>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86SC<BR> <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||FieroHarry||05-14-2001||03:42 AM||||Ken,<BR>I havent made any reservations due to planning this thing at the last minute.<BR>If you dont get somebody from the club, I would gladly take the place....... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR><B>Harry Waggoner</B><BR>FOCOSEVA,FOCOA<BR>1985 GT 262K+ <I>"TEMPTATION"</I>||||reg||12
